      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Doing Homework)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "After I play a little, I have to do all of my homework."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "If I can’t figureout my homework, I can always look on the Internet."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I oftentimes find the answers to my assignments"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "on the World Wide Web."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I get very tired quickly because I have to do homework"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "from both the academies and school."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though I am tired,"
    },
